            },
            {
              "fieldId": "updated_at",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Fail Studio Publish Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1700,
        560
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_HUB_SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trellis: Studio Album Publish (YouTube)\n\nDedicated Studio publisher. Do not point Studio at the Episode workflow: their durable tables and status contracts differ.\n\n**Webhook:** `trellis-studio-album-publish`\n**Secret:** set `STUDIO_PUBLISH_WEBHOOK` on the `studio-albums` Edge Function.\n\nThe Edge Function supplies six-hour signed URLs for the private video and the thumbnail image. This workflow validates Studio IDs, uploads to YouTube, and updates `studio_publications`, `studio_albums`, and `studio_jobs`. Error outputs converge on a failure branch so releases never remain stuck in `submitting`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Map every Supabase node to the Hub service-role credential.\n2. Map the YouTube node AND the Set Studio Thumbnail node to the approved channel OAuth credential.\n3. Keep new releases private for the first live test.\n4. Activate only after the Studio publication migration and Edge Function are deployed.\n\nCustom-thumbnail upload is wired: after the video uploads, Download Studio Thumbnail + Set Studio Thumbnail push the composed 16:9 thumbnail via YouTube thumbnails.set. Both use onError=continueRegularOutput, so a missing thumbnail_url never blocks the release. Verify live once, then rely on it. Scheduling stays disabled until verified end to end.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        -220
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Studio Publish Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate Studio Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Studio Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Mark Studio Uploading",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Studio Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Mark Studio Uploading": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Private Studio Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Studio Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Private Studio Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upload Studio Album to YouTube",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Studio Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
